    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ogr\u00fcuk is a 3D platformer stealth game where ogres have captured all your dogs! You must save them before their cooking pot is at the right temperature! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533370/extras/b4e56f28308a5938e3877807d8eb027a.poster.avif?t=1753441252\" width=100 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533370/extras/b4e56f28308a5938e3877807d8eb027a.webm?t=1753441252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533370/extras/b4e56f28308a5938e3877807d8eb027a.mp4?t=1753441252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak between  monsters and keep away from their lights or you'll also be their dinner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533370/extras/593e9bc8301164c6c251e22a1f433f6c.poster.avif?t=1753441252\" width=250 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533370/extras/593e9bc8301164c6c251e22a1f433f6c.webm?t=1753441252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533370/extras/593e9bc8301164c6c251e22a1f433f6c.mp4?t=1753441252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth: sneak between ogres and cursed lamps </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystical powers: run faster or be invisible for a short period of time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide from the light by crouching down.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels with increasing difficulty </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many dogs to save!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus: collect and save mice!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dangerous and mysterious world</p></li></ul>",
